<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Corporate Express falls into loss.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Corporate Express falls into loss.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Aug 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.36 vs  2.82</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 1.56 vs profit 1.90</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				  140.76 vs 62.36</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			loss 2.0 vs profit 3.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Corporate Express Ltd is office supplies retailer. Major shareholder is Corporate Express Inc</p>
